    "text": "Energy of photon<br /><br /><math><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>E</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>h</mi><mi>c</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><br />Given,<math><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>λ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>5000</mn><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mtext>Å</mtext><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mn>5</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>7&nbsp;</mn></mrow></msup><mtext>m</mtext></math><br /><br /><math><mo>∴</mo><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>E</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>6.6</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>34</mn></mrow></msup><mo>×</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>8</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>5</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>7</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mn>3.96</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>19</mn></mrow></msup><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mtext>J</mtext></math><br /><br />Energy received per second = <math><msup><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow></msup><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">J&nbsp;</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math><br /><br /><math><mo>∴</mo></math> Number of photon's received per second<br /><br />= <math><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><br />= <math><mfrac><mrow><msup><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>3.96</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>19</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>2.5</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow></msup></math>"
